<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-26453] [perfStat] Open .prf file only for read</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-26453</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Performance statistics processor generates .prf file. After that we parse the file with&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
FilePerformanceStatisticsReader and it generates HTML-report. Reader opens the .prf report with Read-Write-Create modes what can cause to AccessDeniedException&lt;br/&gt;
&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
Let&apos;s open .prf file for read only&lt;/p&gt;</description>
